posts.text:
*We are troubled on every side, yet not distressed; we are perplexed, but not in despair; Persecuted, but not forsaken; cast down, but not destroyed*;

That we aren't troubled because our corruptible body will see death but our spirit eternal life in the death and life of Jesus Christ.

This is our faith, and having this faith, it is the good news we speak, and so on as it's spread. We will be together in God's glory, regardless of the trials of this world, and so we faint not. Amen
